    "https://www.sjf.edu/services/human-resources/career-experience/": {
      "title": "Experience the Difference to Make One",
      "description": "Human Resources | Experience Employment at Fisher - St. John Fisher University Skip to content St. John Fisher University Top Searches Parking Information Campus Map Academic Calendars Scholarships Human Resources mySJF Launchpad Registrar's Office Course Search mySJF Career Services Residential Life Majors & Minors Graduate Programs Admissions & Aid Experience Fisher Athletics Student Life Information For Current Students Parents Faculty Staff Alumni Retirees Search About Fisher News & Events Library A-Z List Support Fisher Experience the Difference to Make One The Fisher IMPACT Come work as part of our collaborative community. Current Openings Our Campus Benefits Inclusive Environment “My Fisher career has been very fulfilling. I've experienced professional growth and new relationships with faculty, staff, and students.” Dr. Omar Watts Assistant Professor; Chair, Accounting/Finance 8% Fisher offers a 403(b) with an 8% contribution for employees who contribute at least 2% of their wages toward the retirement plan. View more of our competitive rewards. People Icon Ignite your intellectual curiosity. Fisher engages individuals in lives of intellectual inquiry, professional integrity, and civic responsibility. Come and grow with us . 14 Unplug, rest, and revive with Fisher's 14 paid holidays, generous vacation time, summer hours, and separate paid absences for eligible employees. View additional benefits . People Icon Small School. Global Impact. Fisher’s park-like environment near Rochester, NY provides a picturesque landscape throughout the year and represents a unique vantage for global impact. “I love the community here at Fisher. I deeply enjoy the energy of young adults who are so eagerly beginning their journeys.” Rebecca Kieffer, LCSW-R Director of the Health and Wellness Center People Icon Holistic wellness is a top priority. Fisher offers a top-tier benefits package, and we work to provide events and opportunities to focus on your total health. Participate in the Corporate Challenge with us, join Fisher's family day at Bills' Camp, or walk with colleagues during Walktober. “I love the positive impact that we can have on students, and I feel a lot of pride each year in the things we do to continue improving the community here at Fisher.” Jennifer Granger Director of Athletics and Recreation 100% Fostering a culture of intellectual inquiry, Fisher offers 100% undergraduate tuition remission for full-time employees and their dependents. With several educational assistance plans, Fisher believes in the importance of continuing education and professional development. “From the moment I set foot on the campus 20 years ago, I knew I was stepping into something greater than just a job—I was stepping into a purpose.” Chenno Bowens Executive Assistant to VP of Student Affairs and Dean of Students 2 We value flexibility. Eligible full-time staff may create a flexible or hybrid work schedule that allows for up to 2 days per week of remote work. People Icon Recognizing and rewarding accomplishments. Fisher celebrates the achievements and dedication of our employees . Current Openings Our Campus Benefits Inclusive Environment Map and Directions A-Z List People Directory Employment mySJF Copyright © St. John Fisher University | 3690 East Avenue, Rochester, NY 14618  |  (585) 385-8000 Privacy | Accessibility | Title IX Home || Services || Human Resources || Experience Employment at Fisher"
